{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672800/extras/image.png?t=1745944773\" /><i><strong>Welcome to Unknown TD!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unknown TD</strong> is a <strong>Tower defense</strong> game, with multiple interesting features in the works, we're happy to provide fun semi-casual game for you to enjoy! With a handful of maps and towers along with a <strong>hero tower</strong> for the player to play around with.  <br>  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672800/extras/descriptionImage2.gif?t=1745944773\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>The hero tower</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The hero tower</strong> has a lot of customisation coming to it in future updates, not only limited to pistols, flamethrowers and sun glasses, but a wide array of cosmetics, weapons and abilities!<br><br>  The game is currently in an unfinished state, with plenty more content to come in the form of gamemodes, towers, maps, hero equipment and much much more. Enjoy the (for now) <strong>early access</strong> game!<br>  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672800?t=1745944773","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672800?t=1745944773","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672800/d36e8c4fe974c48589538b5601f9d5bb7732b4cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745944773","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672800/d36e8c4fe974c48589538b5601f9d5bb7732b4cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745944773","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<